      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);\">\n      <div style=\"padding:44px 48px 0;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;\">\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"LNGVTY HUB\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--sectext);line-height:1;\" class=\"\">LNGVTY HUB</div>\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Keto 30-Day Challenge\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);text-align:right;\" class=\"\">keto 30-day challenge</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:34px 48px 44px;\">\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Day 7 · Sunday\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888888;margin-bottom:14px;\" class=\"\">Day 7 | sunday, July 4th</div>\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"One Week Down.\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:56px;line-height:0.92;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sectext);\" class=\"\">one week down.</div>\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Your subheadline goes here.\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:15px;color:var(--secmuted);margin-top:18px;letter-spacing:.5px;\" class=\"\">Taste buds, a story about my son, an your first check-in call.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"height:5px;background:var(--accent);font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    "
    },
    {
      "key": "chStrip",
      "theme": "orange",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:15px 48px;text-align:center;\">\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"★  Two weeks down — you’re at the halfway mark  ★\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sectext);\" class=\"\">★&nbsp; Happy 4th - You're one week stronger&nbsp; &nbsp;★</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    "
    },
    {
      "key": "chBody",
      "theme": "white",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:var(--secbg);padding:44px 48px;\">\n      <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"The good news\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:18px;\" class=\"\">A quick story</div>\n      <p contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"Your paragraph goes here. Write as much as you like — this block is for the letter or intro copy.\" style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--secmuted);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:18px;\" class=\"\">One week down. I want to tell you a story about my son.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: var(--secmuted);\">I</span><span style=\"color: var(--secmuted);\">&nbsp;love making keto mug cakes. I spent weeks perfecting one - tweaking ingredients, trying different sweeteners - until one night I created what I was certain was a masterpiece. I rushed into the other room and made my son taste it. He almost spit it out. </span><span style=\"color: var(--secmuted); font-style: italic;\">\"Dad - when was the last time you actually tasted real cake!?\"</span></p>\n      <p contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"A second paragraph. Delete this line if you don’t need it.\" style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--secmuted);font-weight:300;\" class=\"\">Here's what I realized: my taste buds had changed. Natural sweeteners tasted genuinely sweet to me. I no longer needed sugar to trigger that sensation.</p>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:14px;\"><span contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"— Tim\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--sectext);\" class=\"\">- Tim</span></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    "
    },
    {
      "key": "chCallout",
      "theme": "white",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:#faf7f5;padding:32px 48px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tbody><tr>\n        <td width=\"5\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:5px;background:var(--accent);font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n        <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding-left:20px;\">\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"The big takeaway goes here — one strong sentence.\" style=\"font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:var(--heading);\" class=\"\">Your taste buds completely regenerate every two weeks.</div>\n          <div contenteditable=\"true\" data-ph=\"An optional supporting line underneath.\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#888888;font-weight:300;margin-top:8px;\" class=\"\">Which means you can train new ones - pretty fast.</div>\n        </td>\n      </tr></tbody></table>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    "
    },
    {
